      en: ["Part of the Kwahu Plateau in eastern Ghana", "Peak elevations exceed 600 meters above sea level", "Crucial watershed for numerous local rivers", "Begoro serves as the main agricultural center", "Geologically composed of Voltaian sandstone", "Features a cooler climate than surrounding plains"],
