      en: ["Part of the trans-border Akwapim-Togo mountain range", "Reaches elevations of up to 800 meters", "Significant area for highland coffee and cocoa production", "Characterized by montane forests and numerous waterfalls", "Traditional use of terraced farming techniques", "Geologically composed of quartzites and schists"],
