      en: ["Established as an official resource reserve in 1962.", "The total area of the protected site is 51 square kilometers.", "The Shai people were expelled by the British in 1892.", "Home to over 170 documented species of birds in the area.", "The highest peak among the inselbergs is roughly 290 meters.", "Populations of baboons, antelopes, and bats inhabit the park."],
